      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is the websocket server no longer sending avatar change updates to VRChat client, related to this issue? When I change avatars on the website, it's changed on the website but not live in-app despite multiple attempts to switch avatars in between.\n\nThe issue I'm describing started or became worse this morning, in the past 12 hours.",
